{"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/HandlingErrors"},"abstract":[{"text":"Map every outcome the payment sheet can hand back to merchant-facing behavior.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/molliecomponents\/handlingerrors"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"article","metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","title":"Handling Errors","modules":[{"name":"MollieComponents"}],"role":"article"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every entry point — "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCheckout"},{"type":"text","text":"’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"presentCard(from:)"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"makeCardComponent(onResult:)"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCardComponent"},{"type":"text","text":" directly — resolves to a single "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult"},{"type":"text","text":" with three terminal states:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult\/completed(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" — the payment succeeded; the associated "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePayment"},{"type":"text","text":" carries the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sessionToken"},{"type":"text","text":" you reconcile against your backend."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult\/failed(_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — the flow ended in a failure, carrying a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MollieError"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult\/cancelled"},{"type":"text","text":" — the cardholder dismissed the flow."}]}]}]},{"code":["switch result {","case .completed(let payment):","    \/\/ payment.sessionToken, payment.amount, payment.currency","case .failed(let error):","    \/\/ Inspect error and map to your own localized UI (see the table below)","case .cancelled:","    \/\/ Normal dismissal — not an error","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"Cancellation-is-not-an-error","level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Cancellation is not an error"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult\/cancelled","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is a "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"normal terminal state"}]},{"type":"text","text":", distinct from "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult\/failed(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". It fires when the cardholder dismisses the sheet, taps cancel, or the presenting context is torn down. Do not surface it as an error, log it as a failure, or retry automatically — treat it the way you would a user backing out of any modal. (The underlying "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MollieError"},{"type":"text","text":" cancellation cases listed under "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"#Reserved","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" are never delivered to you; cancellation always surfaces here.)"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"note","name":"Note","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"errorDescription","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" strings on ","type":"text"},{"code":"MollieError","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" are developer- and log-facing copy. They are not localized for cardholders — map each case to your own UI strings using the table below. This is unaffected by the SDK’s own localization support: the cardholder-facing chrome the SDK renders itself (the card form and 3-D Secure screen) is localized and follows the ","type":"text"},{"code":"locale","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" you pass to ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCheckout","type":"reference"},{"text":"‘s ","type":"text"},{"code":"init(clientToken:locale:beforeSubmit:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (default: the device locale), but ","type":"text"},{"code":"MollieError","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" deliberately stays English so it’s safe as log\/support copy regardless of the cardholder’s locale.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"anchor":"Merchant-reachable-cases","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Merchant-reachable cases"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The table below covers every ","type":"text"},{"code":"MollieError","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" case the SDK can deliver in ","type":"text"},{"code":".failed","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Case names are shown in code font; the live documentation for each (Option-click in Xcode) lives on the real ","type":"text"},{"code":"MollieError","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" symbols in the ","type":"text"},{"code":"MollieCore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" module.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Case"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Meaning \/ Cause","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Recommended action","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".network(URLError)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Transport failure before any HTTP response (offline, DNS, TLS, URL-layer timeout). The SDK auto-retries transient transport failures for idempotent reads (GET\/PUT\/DELETE) only; charging POSTs (tokenisation, checkout-attempt creation) surface on the first failure with an indeterminate outcome."}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Transient. Prompt “check your connection and try again”; inspect "},{"code":"URLError.code","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for specifics. Re-presenting starts a fresh attempt — for a charging operation, reconcile server-side first rather than blindly re-charging."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".api(.unauthorized)"},{"type":"text","text":" (401)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The bearer ","type":"text"},{"code":"clientToken","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is missing, expired, or invalid.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Merchant fix: your backend mints a fresh session and hands the new token to the SDK. Not retryable with the same token."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".api(.forbidden)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (403)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Authenticated but not permitted — wrong profile, payment method not enabled, or test\/live mode mismatch."}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Configuration fix; refreshing the token won’t help. Verify the profile and mode. Contact support if entitlements look correct."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".api(.notFound)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (404)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Resource missing: the session expired or never existed, or the base URL\/path is wrong.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Confirm the token is current and the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieEndpoints","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" are correct; otherwise create a new session.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".api(.validationFailed([Violation]))","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (422)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"RFC 7807 field violations — usually bad card input (often rewrapped as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".tokenizationFailed"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Map each "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Violation.name"},{"type":"text","text":" to a form field and show its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"reason"},{"type":"text","text":" inline. Cardholder-retryable."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".api(.conflict(retryAfter:))","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (409)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A competing or duplicate operation on the session."}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The SDK auto-retries idempotent ops only, honouring "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"retryAfter"},{"type":"text","text":" when present; a charging POST surfaces immediately (no auto-retry). On a charging operation, reconcile or create a new session rather than re-charging blindly."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".api(.rateLimited(retryAfter:))","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (429)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The request was throttled."}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The SDK auto-retries idempotent ops only, honouring ","type":"text"},{"code":"retryAfter","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (falling back to jittered exponential backoff); a charging POST surfaces immediately. Don’t hard-fail to the cardholder on a 429 from a read — the SDK is already backing off. If it surfaces from a charge, review your call cadence before re-presenting.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".api(.serverError(Int))"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"An unexpected HTTP status (the wrapped ","type":"text"},{"code":"Int","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", e.g. 500\/502\/503).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A 5xx is server-classified transient: the SDK auto-retries it with jittered backoff for idempotent ops only. A charging POST is ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"never"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" auto-retried on 5xx — the outcome is indeterminate, so it surfaces for server-side reconciliation before any re-charge. An unexpected 4xx is likely an integration issue — contact support with the status code.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".invalidClientToken(reason:)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"clientToken","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is not valid base64 or its JSON failed to parse.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Integration error: forward the exact "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"client_access_token"},{"type":"text","text":" verbatim — no re-encoding or truncation — and confirm it was not already consumed. Not retryable."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".timeout(operation:)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The polling budget was exhausted, an attempt got stuck, or no terminal event arrived ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"operation"},{"type":"text","text":" is one of session-polling, checkout-attempt-polling, checkout-attempt-stuck, card-payment). Outcome is "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"indeterminate"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reconcile server-side before re-presenting — do not silently re-charge. Surface “we’re confirming your payment”. The polling budget ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pollingTimeoutSeconds"},{"type":"text","text":") is configurable."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".sessionFailed(ProblemDetails?)"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A backend terminal failure, or the SDK rejected an unsafe 3DS challenge or redirect URL (","type":"text"},{"code":"title: \"invalid_configuration\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"detail: \"Unsafe 3DS challenge URL\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"Unsafe redirect URL\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":").","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A genuine decline → read ","type":"text"},{"code":"ProblemDetails.detail","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"\/","type":"text"},{"code":".title","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and suggest another card. For the “Unsafe … URL” variants → a security\/configuration signal; contact support with the session token (the cardholder cannot fix this).","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".tokenizationFailed(reason:underlying:)"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Card-to-token conversion failed during tokenisation — a validation rewrap, or another error in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"underlying"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Usually a mistyped card: show ","type":"text"},{"code":"reason","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and prompt re-entry. If ","type":"text"},{"code":"underlying","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is a network or server error, the tokenisation POST is ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" auto-retried (it is a charging op with no server-honoured dedup) and the outcome may be indeterminate — a re-attempt should follow server-side reconciliation rather than a blind re-charge. (","type":"text"},{"code":"reason","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is safe to display — the SDK never logs PAN or CVC.)","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".threeDSFailed(reason:)"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"3D Secure did not succeed. See the "},{"code":"ThreeDSFailureReason","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" cases below."}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Depends on the reason — see the next table."}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".invalidConfiguration(field:reason:)"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Misuse or an unsupported host state, split by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"field"},{"type":"text","text":". "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cardNumber"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"expiry"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cardholderName"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cvc"},{"type":"text","text":" are "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"cardholder-correctable"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (show "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"reason"},{"type":"text","text":" inline). "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"host"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"scene"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sheet"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"submit"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"checkoutAttemptToken"},{"type":"text","text":" are "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"integration bugs"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (present from a VC in a window, not while another modal is up; require an active foreground scene; no double-submit). "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"validator\/parser disagreement\""},{"type":"text","text":" is an SDK bug."}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Fix the integration for the host-state fields; show ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"reason"},{"text":" inline for the card-field ones. Report the “validator\/parser disagreement” variant to Mollie.","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".unknown(Error)"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Unclassified catch-all — in practice where uncaught ","type":"text"},{"code":"DecodingError","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"s land.","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Allow one retry. If it persists, capture the wrapped description plus request context and contact support. Engineering should monitor ","type":"text"},{"code":".unknown","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" rates (spikes ≈ contract drift).","type":"text"}]}]]]},{"anchor":"3D-Secure-failures","level":3,"type":"heading","text":"3D Secure failures"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".threeDSFailed(reason:)"},{"type":"text","text":" is delivered, the associated "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ThreeDSFailureReason"},{"type":"text","text":" narrows the cause:"}]},{"rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Reason","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Meaning \/ Cause","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Recommended action","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".challengeFailed"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The bank rejected authentication — wrong OTP, the banking app wasn’t approved, or the cardholder cancelled the challenge.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Cardholder-retryable, or suggest another card.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".sdkError(message:)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A WebView or ACS technical failure (","type":"text"},{"code":"navigation_error_<code>","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"Unsafe navigation blocked\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"timeout\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"3DS error <code>","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"mollie_error_<code>","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Mostly transient → retry. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"Unsafe navigation blocked\""},{"type":"text","text":" is a security signal — contact support. Do not show the raw "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"message"},{"type":"text","text":"; map it to a generic “couldn’t complete authentication”."}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"type":"table","header":"row"},{"text":"Reserved","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Reserved"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The following cases are "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"declared but never currently emitted","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" by the SDK. They exist on the types for forward-compatibility. You do "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not"}]},{"type":"text","text":" need to write dead "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"catch"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"switch"},{"type":"text","text":" arms for them — handling the merchant-reachable cases above plus a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"default"},{"type":"text","text":" is sufficient:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"MollieError.sessionExpired","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — session expiry surfaces as "},{"code":".api(.notFound)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"code":".timeout","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", not this case."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"MollieError.sessionCancelled","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — cancellation surfaces as "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult\/cancelled","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MollieError.userCancelled"},{"type":"text","text":" — cancellation surfaces as "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult\/cancelled","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MollieError.decoding(DecodingError)"},{"type":"text","text":" — decode failures currently fall through to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".unknown"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"ThreeDSFailureReason.timeout","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — the 3DS timeout path currently uses ","type":"text"},{"code":".sdkError(\"timeout\")","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"ThreeDSFailureReason.unknown","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — no current code path constructs it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"These are reserved as documentation only — there is no associated API change. A future SDK release may begin emitting some of them; until then, treat them as unreachable.","type":"text"}]}]},{"text":"Supporting payload types","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Supporting-payload-types"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Three supporting types carry the detail you map into merchant UI:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"ProblemDetails","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" — the RFC 7807 body on "},{"code":".sessionFailed","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Inspect "},{"code":"type","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"title","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"detail","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"status","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"instance","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"code":"extensions","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". The SDK synthesizes "},{"code":"\"invalid_configuration\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (with the “Unsafe … URL” detail) for the URL-safety rejections, and falls back to "},{"code":"\"unknown\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" when the server body can’t be parsed."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Violation"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — one per field error inside "},{"code":".api(.validationFailed)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". "},{"code":"name","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" identifies the offending form field; "},{"code":"reason","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is display-ready copy you can show inline."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":".tokenizationFailed.underlying","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"text":" — inspect this wrapped error to tell a validation failure (cardholder mistyped) apart from a network or server failure. Tokenisation is a charging POST, so the SDK does not auto-retry it; on a network\/server failure the outcome may be indeterminate, and any re-attempt should follow server-side reconciliation rather than a blind re-charge.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://build.MollieComponents/documentation/MollieComponents/MolliePaymentResult/completed(_:)":{"abstract":[],"title":"MolliePaymentResult.completed(_:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"completed"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MolliePayment","preciseIdentifier":"s:16MollieComponents0A7PaymentV"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/molliecomponents\/molliepaymentresult\/completed(_:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult\/completed(_:)","type":"topic"},"doc://build.MollieComponents/documentation/MollieComponents/MollieCardComponent":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MollieCardComponent"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MollieCardComponent"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCardComponent","abstract":[{"text":"Embeddable SwiftUI surface for the Mollie card form.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/molliecomponents\/molliecardcomponent","title":"MollieCardComponent","type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://build.MollieComponents/documentation/MollieComponents/MolliePaymentResult/cancelled":{"role":"symbol","title":"MolliePaymentResult.cancelled","url":"\/documentation\/molliecomponents\/molliepaymentresult\/cancelled","abstract":[],"fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"cancelled","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/build.Moll